🖥️ Host
Host basically tumhara physical machine ya main operating system hota hai.

Ye hardware resources (CPU, RAM, Disk, Network) ko manage karta hai aur unhe applications ko provide karta hai.

Example: Agar tum Windows ya Linux install karke apna laptop use kar rahe ho, to wo tumhara host OS hai.

⚙️ Kernel
Kernel ek core part of operating system hota hai jo directly hardware ke saath interact karta hai.

Ye ek bridge hai jo hardware aur applications ke beech communication karata hai.

Kernel ke kaam:

Memory management (RAM allocate karna )

Process scheduling (kaunsa program CPU use karega)

Device management (keyboard, disk, network handle karna)

Security aur isolation

